<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 2-5.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 2-5.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for May 2</p>
<p>- May 5. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a</p>
<p>German mark.</p>
<p>	    May 2-5	 April 30-May 2</p>
<p> CZK	0.44601	    0.44675</p>
<p> DKK	2.10159	    2.10124</p>
<p> FIM	2.65559	    2.65017</p>
<p> HUF	0.07575	    0.07583</p>
<p> JPY	0.10881	    0.10898</p>
<p> LTL	3.44436	    3.45436</p>
<p> LVL     23.65854	   23.73336</p>
<p> RUR	0.00239	    0.0024</p>
<p> SEK	1.76162	    1.76436</p>
<p> UAH	7.56813	    7.59011</p>
<p> USD     13.774	     13.814</p>
<p> XEU     15.58597	   15.61604</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
